<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of June 20, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						June 20  WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,259  1,155   1,725</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 47     44	50</p>
<p>CCC					    1,077  1,127     917</p>
<p>TOTAL					  2,383  2,326   2,692</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,196  1,150   1,643</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				189    185     151</p>
<p>CCC						808    758   1,959</p>
<p>TOTAL					  2,193  2,493   3,753</p>
